    "reviews": "\u201c[\u2026] the artist Rhett Tsai has created a project that addresses the concept of war not so much as a contrast between good and evil, but as a source of transversal and immensely complex historical emotions.\u201d<br>Neural<br><br>\u201cI rarely see a Chinese artist in game creation who can embody both the vision of indie games and experimental games [\u2026]\u201d<br>Sunset-Sway (\u843d\u65e5\u95f4)<br><br>\u201cThis work is not only a reflection on war, but also an exploration of human destiny.\u201d<br>Art and Design (\u827a\u672f\u4e0e\u8bbe\u8ba1)<br>",
